 'entropy' criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":216454,"global_rank":245061},{"name":"matsengrp/bioboxmixcr","owner":"matsengrp","html_url":"https://github.com/matsengrp/bioboxmixcr","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A biobox (http://bioboxes.org/) for Mixcr (https://github.com/milaboratory/mixcr)","topics":[],"score":216450,"global_rank":245064},{"name":"davisagli/Products.RelationIndex","owner":"davisagli","html_url":"https://github.com/davisagli/Products.RelationIndex","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"ZCatalog index of object relations","topics":[],"score":216450,"global_rank":245065},{"name":"kevinlin311tw/CSE517-language-models","owner":"kevinlin311tw","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinlin311tw/CSE517-language-models","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216450,"global_rank":245069},{"name":"Harshit-Shrivastava/Search","owner":"Harshit-Shrivastava","html_url":"https://github.com/Harshit-Shrivastava/Search","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":["artificial-intelligence","machine-learning","optmization","search-algorithm"],"score":216450,"global_rank":245071},{"name":"jacksonwelsh/raspi-wifilights","owner":"jacksonwelsh","html_url":"https://github.com/jacksonwelsh/raspi-wifilights","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216450,"global_rank":245073},{"name":"keithchambers/langgraph-researcher","owner":"keithchambers","html_url":"https://github.com/keithchambers/langgraph-researcher","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":216448,"global_rank":245077},{"name"